{"about_the_game":"<i>Set in a world where they worship the stars, play as the newly crowned Ruling Monarch of the kingdom of Laut\u00e9. In ancient times, the Royals were masters of the elements with the ability to spellcraft that made people believe they were gods. Nowadays, the ability has faded with misuse, and the only Royal left known to have this ability is King Aalam of Andromeda. With your kingdom on unsteady ground after your father's recent assassination, this dangerous King with magic beyond comprehension has an offer you can\u2019t ignore: Accept his hand in marriage, or go to war.</i><br><br>A <strong>story-driven</strong> narrative with <strong>stat-building </strong>aspects. Make choices to build stats in nine different personality facets, creating your own monarch and giving a different experience each time. Take the throne and find love! Become the Monarch of Laute, and try to keep your kingdom afloat in three branching romance routes. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338180/extras/7ce5c072bdbd6d600dca6b160ce8c3a8.avif?t=1770774214\" width=615 height=122 /></span><br><br>All 3 love interests have their own plot within the overarching story of Celestial Crowns. The routes will vary greatly, feature 60K+ words of new content, and allow you to visit new locations and meet new characters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338180/extras/5fe68eebd6a4b2d4f8511f6b0d7870a4.avif?t=1770774214\" width=616 height=280 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338180/extras/a0374f9652f7beef62e7f3ecacb8dc1e.avif?t=1770774214\" width=616 height=280 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2